        <div id="who-should-skip" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            10. Who Should Skip Micellar Casein Protein Powder?
          </h2>

          <p>
            Skip micellar casein if you have a milk allergy, if you want a fast post-workout protein, or if you already eat enough protein from food. It is a useful tool for a specific job, not a product everyone needs.
          </p>

          <p>
            A cow's milk allergy usually involves casein, whey or both, so casein powder is off the table; a plant protein is the alternative. Lactose intolerance is different. Micellar casein keeps a little lactose because filtration does not remove all of it, but the labels here show 0 to 4 g of carbohydrate per serving, and many people with mild intolerance handle that amount. If even small amounts bother you, our <a href="/best-lactose-free-protein-powder/">best lactose-free protein powder</a> guide covers options. Dymatize Elite Casein also contains soy, which matters for soy-allergic buyers.
          </p>

          <p>
            People who want a protein to drink right after training are usually better served by whey, which reaches the muscle faster and contains more leucine. And if you eat a protein-rich dinner and hit your daily target without supplements, adding casein at night mainly adds calories and cost. The research does not show that casein in itself does anything special beyond supplying protein at a convenient time.
          </p>

          <p>
            Finally, the thickness that makes casein good for pudding is a drawback for some. Buyers commonly report that it is harder to mix in a shaker bottle than whey and can feel heavy on the stomach. If you are trying to gain weight and want calories as well as protein, a mass gainer may fit better; our sibling reviews of <a href="/dymatize-super-mass-gainer-review/">Dymatize Super Mass Gainer</a> and <a href="/transparent-labs-mass-gainer-review/">Transparent Labs Mass Gainer</a> look at two of them, and the <a href="/best-casein-protein-powder/">best casein protein powder</a> guide remains the place to compare more casein options.
          </p>
        </div>

