                  For most healthy adults, yes. Micellar casein is a complete dairy protein that is low in fat and sugar in unflavored form and high in calcium, with the labels here that list it showing 500 to 580 mg per serving. Flavored versions add sweeteners and gums. People with kidney disease, milk allergy or medical conditions should ask a doctor or registered dietitian first.
